WEBVTT

00:00.701 --> 00:03.108
Problem : Funksioni f(x) ndodhet ne graf

00:03.108 --> 00:05.395
Gjeni f (-1)

00:05.395 --> 00:07.502
Ky grafik ketu eshte ne thelb

00:07.502 --> 00:09.082
ai qe percakton funksionin.

00:09.082 --> 00:12.281
Ai tregon se "Nese fusim te dhenat e lejuara te funksionit

00:12.281 --> 00:14.375
cilat do te jene perfundimet?"

00:14.375 --> 00:15.502
Pra, aty thuhet se

00:15.502 --> 00:21.500
"Cili do te jete perfundimi nese fusim te dhena ne funksionin x=-1?"

00:21.500 --> 00:24.126
x=-1 ndodhet ne kete pike

00:24.126 --> 00:25.970
x=-1

00:25.970 --> 00:29.928
dhe grafiku i funksionit ndodhet tek 6

00:29.928 --> 00:32.671
kur f eshte e barabarte me -1

00:32.671 --> 00:36.815
Atehere mund te themi se f(-1)=6

00:36.815 --> 00:38.078
Kete po e shkruaj ketu.

00:38.078 --> 00:41.711
f(-1)=6
